{"skill":{"slug":"auto-updater","displayName":"Auto-Updater Skill"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768323539453,"changelog":"Automatically checks for and applies updates to Clawdbot and all installed skills once daily via cron.\n\nSends the user a message summarizing what was updated and any issues encountered.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3300,"sha256":"4142916e146caa90d41cd274bdea6263da1738d8ecc81777b7fc19c6bd8ef9f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/agent-guide.md","size":3767,"sha256":"006191441b38b44f839f0c78513c85cc40e6d8a37dae9cfeab242efc4a3acc4c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/summary-examples.md","size":2513,"sha256":"9f0c386e2fee1fe5c723eef7fcb523f2294463b2456e2f615e38f2df41975d48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2236,"sha256":"7fb91f1f9c9d20e80ff0fafe5100acb26b6ce4798ca9783f4dc94bdbe8e308cf","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789015612047,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"1755e5b85c1736ce833f0513ff00c91c615b97018de634accb7139c31f9509b7","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/1755e5b85c1736ce833f0513ff00c91c615b97018de634accb7139c31f9509b7","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: auto-updater\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe 'auto-updater' skill is designed to automatically update Clawdbot and all installed skills via a daily cron job. The `SKILL.md` and `references/agent-guide.md` files contain instructions for the AI agent to set up a shell script (`auto-update.sh`) and a cron job. This script executes legitimate update commands (`npm update -g`, `pnpm update -g`, `bun update -g`, `clawdbot update`, `clawdbot doctor`, `clawdhub update --all`), logs actions locally, and provides a structured summary. While the skill has broad system access necessary for its function, there is no evidence of intentional malicious behavior such as data exfiltration, unauthorized remote execution, persistence beyond the stated cron job, or prompt injection designed to subvert the agent's purpose or security.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159726853},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":48,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":5,"checkedAt":1789015612047},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is transparent about setting up daily updates, but it can automatically replace Clawdbot and every installed skill without fresh approval.","dimensions":[{"detail":"For an updater, network and package manager use are expected, but updating global Clawdbot installs and every installed skill is broader than a narrowly scoped maintenance check.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The package is documentation-only, but its setup flow creates a durable Clawdbot cron job and optionally a helper script under `~/.clawdbot/scripts/auto-update.sh`.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The instructions schedule an isolated cron session to run npm/pnpm/bun/source updates, `clawdbot doctor --yes`, and `clawdhub update --all` without pinning, provenance checks, staging, rollback, or per-update approval.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill intentionally establishes daily persistent execution and persistent logs; it does not show privilege escalation, but it grants ongoing mutation authority under the account running Clawdbot.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The advertised purpose and commands align, but the capability is high impact: recurring updates to the agent runtime and all installed skills using mutable latest/all update targets.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable allowing a daily job to modify Clawdbot and every installed skill automatically. Prefer dry-run notifications, explicit approval before installation, pinned or verified versions, backups, and a clear rollback and disable process before enabling this in a sensitive environment.","findings":"[T06] expected: Accepted as a material Review concern: scheduled persistence is disclosed and purpose-aligned, but the scheduled task performs unattended runtime and skill modifications.\n[T08] expected: Accepted as a material Review concern: updating to current releases is the point of the skill, but the artifacts do not require exact versions, signature or checksum verification, publisher allowlisting, or approval before installing updates.\n[RA1] expected: The self-modifying behavior is not hidden or malicious by itself because the skill is an auto-updater, but bulk automatic updates of Clawdbot and all skills materially expand supply-chain risk.\n[SQP-2] expected: The higher-impact under-disclosure concern is supported: the setup text says what will update, but lacks a clear warning that future remote package and skill changes will be installed automatically.\n[RA2] expected: Persistent helper and cron behavior are expected for this skill, but they contribute to the Review verdict because they continue running beyond the setup session.\n[SQP-2] expected: The log-file issue is minor: the helper script discloses the log path in code, but does not specify restrictive permissions, rotation, or redaction.\n[SQP-3] unexpected: Downgraded as not security-material: the example hardcodes America/Los_Angeles, but the guide also shows timezone customization.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789015612047}}}}}